# =============================================================================
# HARMONY — Unity .gitignore
#
# Bu depo yalnizca Unity projesini ve README gorsellerini yayinlar. Kok dizinde
# beyaz liste kullanilir: asagida acikca izin verilmeyen hicbir sey commit
# edilmez. Boylece yerel calisma klasorleri, IDE durumu, derleme ciktilari ve
# Unity'nin urettigi klasorler tek kural ile disarida kalir.
#
# Baz alinan dosya: https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Unity.gitignore
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kok dizin — sadece asagidakiler yayinlanir
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
!/Assets/
!/Packages/
!/ProjectSettings/
!/docs/
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# docs/ — sadece README'nin kullandigi sekiller yayinlanir
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/docs/*
!/docs/diagrams/
!/docs/images/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unity ve IDE tarafindan uretilen dosyalar (Assets/ ve Packages/ icinde)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.log
*.DotSettings.user
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# Unity3D tarafindan uretilen meta dosyalari
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# Cokme raporlari
sysinfo.txt
mono_crash.*
crashlytics-build.properties

# Isletim sistemi artiklari
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
desktop.ini.meta

# Derleme ciktilari
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta
*.app

# Blender yedekleri
*.blend1
*.blend1.meta

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Addressables
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/aa*
/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/link.xml*
/[Aa]ssets/Addressables_Temp*
/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*/*.bin*

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Visual Scripting tarafindan uretilen dosyalar
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db
/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db.meta
/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers
/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers.meta

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TestRunner artiklari
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
InitTestScene*.unity*
/[Aa]ssets/[Ii]nit[Tt]est[Ss]cene*.unity*

# =============================================================================
# LISANSLI UCUNCU TARAF PAKETI — Modern UI Pack (Michsky)
#
# Tum HARMONY arayuzu (paneller, butonlar, modal pencereler, HUD ogeleri) bu
# ticari Unity Asset Store paketi uzerine kuruludur. Unity Asset Store EULA'si
# paketin yalnizca Asset Store uzerinden edinilen kopyalarinin kullanilmasina
# izin verir; paketi bir genel (public) Git deposu uzerinden yeniden dagitmak
# bu lisansi ihlal eder.
#
# Bu nedenle paket depoda tutulmaz. Yerel projede durmaya devam eder, sadece
# commit edilmez. Kurulum icin README.md icindeki "Modern UI Pack (zorunlu
# Asset Store paketi)" bolumune bakin.
# =============================================================================
/[Aa]ssets/3rd Party/Modern UI Pack/
/[Aa]ssets/3rd Party/Modern UI Pack.meta

# Ileride Sci-Fi temali ticari UI paketi import edilirse o da depoya girmesin.
/[Aa]ssets/SCI-FI UI Pack Pro/
/[Aa]ssets/SCI-FI UI Pack Pro.meta

# =============================================================================
# LISANSLI SDK ARSIVLERI
# Vuforia Engine ve VisionLib SDK ticari dagitimlardir ve tek baslarina
# GitHub'in 100 MB dosya sinirini asarlar. Kendi lisansinizla edinip
# Packages/ altina kopyalayin.
# =============================================================================
/[Pp]ackages/com.ptc.vuforia.engine-*.tgz
/[Pp]ackages/VisionLib.SDK-Unity-*.tgz

# VisionLib SDK ornek sahneleri, modelleri ve izleme yapilandirmalari
/[Aa]ssets/VisionLib MagicLeap Examples/
/[Aa]ssets/VisionLib MagicLeap Examples.meta
/[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/VisionLib/
/[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/VisionLib.meta

# =============================================================================
# GIZLI BILGILER
# config.ini canli MySQL sunucu adresi ve kimlik bilgilerini tasir.
# Depoya config.ini.example (sablon) girer, gercek dosya girmez.
# =============================================================================
/[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/config.ini
/[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/config.ini.meta
*.example.meta

# =============================================================================
# PROJE DOKUMANLARI — depoya girmez (yalnizca Unity projesi yayinlanir)
# =============================================================================
/[Aa]ssets/*.docx
/[Aa]ssets/*.docx.meta
/[Aa]ssets/*.pdf
/[Aa]ssets/*.pdf.meta
/[Aa]ssets/*.py
/[Aa]ssets/*.py.meta
/[Aa]ssets/HARMONY_DataFlow_Figure5_3.png
/[Aa]ssets/HARMONY_DataFlow_Figure5_3.png.meta

# =============================================================================
# EGITIM / TEST MATERYALI — depoya girmez
# =============================================================================
# Nesne algilama egitim hatti, sentetik veri seti ve egitim ciktilari (~115 MB)
/[Aa]ssets/training/
/[Aa]ssets/training.meta

# Nesne algilama test veri seti
/[Aa]ssets/Models/test/
/[Aa]ssets/Models/test.meta

# Models/ klasorunun takip edilen icerigi kalmadi; sahipsiz .meta uyarisi olmasin
/[Aa]ssets/Models.meta

# CAD kaynak dosyalari (door1.stp tek basina 122 MB — GitHub sinirinin uzerinde)
/[Aa]ssets/Models/StepFiles/
/[Aa]ssets/Models/StepFiles.meta

# Gelistirme sirasinda alinan hata ayiklama ekran goruntuleri
/[Aa]ssets/Screenshots/
/[Aa]ssets/Screenshots.meta

# Deneme sahnesi
/[Aa]ssets/Scenes/XR_Deneme.unity
/[Aa]ssets/Scenes/XR_Deneme.unity.meta
